            <div class="product-price">42.000.000 đ</div>
            <div class="product-title">
                VGA COLORFUL iGAME GEFORCE RTX 5080 ULTRA W OC 16GB-V (GDDR7, 256-bit, HDMI +DP, 1x16-pin)
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ps-foot">
            <span class="ps-stock">Sẵn hàng</span>
